---
// Free and premium: two flat price tiles, the highlight passes between them.
---

<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 px-6">
  <div class="ill-tile ill-swap px-5 py-4">
    <p class="type-caption text-muted">Free</p>
    <p class="type-h3 mt-1">$0</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ill-tile ill-swap px-5 py-4" style="animation-delay: 3s">
    <p class="type-caption text-muted">Premium</p>
    <p class="type-h3 mt-1">$49</p>
  </div>
</div>
